<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-TURKEY BEAT SAN MARINO 7-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TURKEY BEAT SAN MARINO 7-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey beat San Marino 7-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in their World Cup European group seven</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Oktay Derelioglu 24, 38, 50, 60, Hakan Sukur 55,</p>
<p>65, Ertugrul Saglam 80</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
<p>Group seven Standings:</p>
<p> Netherlands	  2   2   0   0  10   2   6</p>
<p> Belgium		2   2   0   0   5   1   6</p>
<p> Wales		  4   2   0   2  13  10   6</p>
<p> Turkey		 2   1   0   1   8   2   3</p>
<p> San Marino	   4   0   0   4   0  21   0</p>
<p>Next matches: Dec 14 Belgium v Netherlands, Wales v Turkey</p>
</text>
